---
description: Rules for LiteLLM chat calls inside LLM chat elements.
globs: "**/llm_chat/**/*.py"
---
- `LiteLLMChatModel.generate_response` converts payloads with `to_chat_completions` and calls `litellm.acompletion`. `LLMChatElement` defaults to the OpenRouter backend and can also select OpenAI, Anthropic, Cloudflare AI Gateway, and mock.
- `langchain-text-splitters` splits text in the chunker. It does not perform chat completions.
